OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Two people died today as police stormed
OL,6, a house in the black township of
OL,7, Inanda, south of Durban in South Arica.
OL,9,FPolice said they stormed the house
OL,10,Fafter hearing a gun being loaded inside
OL,12,FA suspected member of the African
OL,13,FNational Congress was shot dead after
OL,14,Fhe opened fire with an automatic rifle,
OL,15,Fpolice said.
OL,17,FA woman in the house was also killed -
OL,18,Fapparently by a police grenade.
OL,20,FAnother man was said to have severe
OL,21,Fabdominal injuries and a two-month-old
OL,22,Fbaby was slightly hurt.
OL,23,                      D]CFrom 17-03-86
