OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G8/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Scotland soccer international Mo
OL,6, Johnston has been found guilty of
OL,7, assault at Glasgow Sheriff Court.
OL,9,FJohnston, 23, of Mount Vernon, Glasgow,
OL,10,Fwho plays for Celtic, was fined #50
OL,11,Ffor the assault last November on a 19-
OL,12,Fyear-old hairdresser at a discotheque.
OL,14,FGeorge Lynch, 27, of Balornoch,
OL,15,FGlasgow, described in court as the
OL,16,Ffootballer's "minder", was also
OL,17,Fconvicted of assault and fined #250.
OL,20,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 17-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
